      },
      "body": {
        "en": "*Masz ochotę pójść…?* asks a friend whether they feel like going somewhere; to several people it is *macie ochotę*. *Pójść* is to go, once: *chcesz pójść na spektakl?*. *Zaproszenie* is an invitation, and *mam trzy zaproszenia* is I have three of them."
      }
